    },
    {
      "subId": "1917351",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735101": {
            "id": "191735101",
            "speakerId": 12603,
            "speakerName": "Karkata",
            "text": "Kolu...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191735102"
            ]
          },
          "191735102": {
            "id": "191735102",
            "speakerId": 1067,
            "speakerName": "Faruzan",
            "text": "Who knew that I'd encounter a mechanical life form in this manner after a hundred years?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917352",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735201": {
            "id": "191735201",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "I didn't know mechanical life forms could get sick, too... You have to get better soon, Karkata!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917353",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735301": {
            "id": "191735301",
            "speakerId": 1050,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "A \"Fully Automated Irrigation System\"... That's quite the task.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191735302"
            ]
          },
          "191735302": {
            "id": "191735302",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "Master, can I help with anything at all? I can go buy things, prepare pen and paper...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191735303"
            ]
          },
          "191735303": {
            "id": "191735303",
            "speakerId": 1050,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Oh, you know, I seem to remember that you have a lot of homework today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191735304"
            ]
          },
          "191735304": {
            "id": "191735304",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "Huh? O—Oh, yeah, I do...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191735305"
            ]
          },
          "191735305": {
            "id": "191735305",
            "speakerId": 1050,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Well, hurry up and finish it so you can sleep early, or Faruzan will worry. That's the best thing you can do now to help.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191735306"
            ]
          },
          "191735306": {
            "id": "191735306",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "Oh... Okay...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191735307"
            ]
          },
          "191735307": {
            "id": "191735307",
            "speakerId": 12603,
            "speakerName": "Karkata",
            "text": "Kolu..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917354",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735401": {
            "id": "191735401",
            "speakerId": 12932,
            "speakerName": "Bakr",
            "text": "Halt! Mr. Raed's permission is required to proceed any further!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917355",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735501": {
            "id": "191735501",
            "speakerId": 12935,
            "speakerName": "Raed",
            "text": "There's a tent that the villagers occasionally use to rest. Like I said, it's a bit simple, yes, but I hope you won't mind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917356",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735601": {
            "id": "191735601",
            "speakerId": 12935,
            "speakerName": "Raed",
            "text": "Ah, sorry for disturbing your rest. I'll tell my subordinates to be quieter in the future."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917357",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735701": {
            "id": "191735701",
            "speakerId": 12939,
            "speakerName": "Machine Wreckage",
            "text": "(The wreckage of the huge machine remains motionless...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917358",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735801": {
            "id": "191735801",
            "speakerId": 1067,
            "speakerName": "Faruzan",
            "text": "(Faruzan's head hangs low in silence... The desert breathes gales of wind, and the only sound that can be heard is the scattering rise of spreading grains.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917359",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191735901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191735901": {
            "id": "191735901",
            "speakerId": 12603,
            "speakerName": "Karkata",
            "text": "Kalu! Kalu!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191735902"
            ]
          },
          "191735902": {
            "id": "191735902",
            "speakerId": 1051,
            "speakerName": "Collei",
            "text": "It looks fine, but even so, it needs to properly rest up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917360",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191736001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191736001": {
            "id": "191736001",
            "speakerId": 1050,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "Faruzan went out after repairing Karkata. She seems to be looking for you for some reason.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191736002"
            ]
          },
          "191736002": {
            "id": "191736002",
            "speakerId": 1050,
            "speakerName": "Tighnari",
            "text": "...Well, I will not probe any further. However, if you need any help, do feel free to ask."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917361",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191736101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191736101": {
            "id": "191736101",
            "speakerId": 12936,
            "speakerName": "Tired Villager",
            "text": "Ugh... So we still can't go back to Aaru Village?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917362",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191736201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191736201": {
            "id": "191736201",
            "speakerId": 12937,
            "speakerName": "Curious Villager",
            "text": "Just what are they digging for?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917363",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191736301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191736301": {
            "id": "191736301",
            "speakerId": 12938,
            "speakerName": "Chatty Villager",
            "text": "That huge machine looks amazing!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917372",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191737201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191737201": {
            "id": "191737201",
            "speakerId": 12954,
            "speakerName": "Neatly-Penned Note",
            "text": "\"Dear Madam Faruzan...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191737202"
            ]
          },
          "191737202": {
            "id": "191737202",
            "speakerId": 12954,
            "speakerName": "Neatly-Penned Note",
            "text": "\"The notes and manuscripts we found on Tamimi have been transcribed and organized, and every one of them has been marked with your name.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191737203"
            ]
          },
          "191737203": {
            "id": "191737203",
            "speakerId": 12954,
            "speakerName": "Neatly-Penned Note",
            "text": "\"I hope that even after a hundred years, future generations of students will still remember your name, Madam Faruzan.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917373",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191737301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191737301": {
            "id": "191737301",
            "speakerId": 12956,
            "speakerName": "Oft-Corrected Note",
            "text": "\"... I told you not to... Now, look... So many people... Worried... Even... Tamimi...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191737302"
            ]
          },
          "191737302": {
            "id": "191737302",
            "speakerId": 12956,
            "speakerName": "Oft-Corrected Note",
            "text": "(The messy scribbling has been repeatedly canceled and edited, leaving barely legible phrases and a single neat message at the back.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191737303"
            ]
          },
          "191737303": {
            "id": "191737303",
            "speakerId": 12956,
            "speakerName": "Oft-Corrected Note",
            "text": "\"Hurry up and come home for a meal. Your mom always makes an extra portion of food, you know?\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1917374",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
